      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来她不打算正面迎击，\n而是采用仅仅针对大鸣大放的尾段加速\n进行反制的特殊作战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ffb291604f477e8d8d8fb7acf98062d549781d3dcecd43d0f0c25c27c61b568",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
