      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那感觉同时也在同场竞赛的选手们，\n以及观看比赛的观众们的心里\n留下深刻的印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d70880c6947555373eba3748daf6f1522f75357cf3da50b3939d247122ea82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
